  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3705,
      "text": "If Allah were to take people to task for what they did, He would not leave a single living being on earth, but He gives them respite for an appointed term. When their appointed time comes, then Allah is All-Seeing of His slaves.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 35,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فَاطِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Faatir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Originator",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 440,
      "ruku": 380,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3706,
      "text": "Yā Sīn[1]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 440,
      "ruku": 381,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3707,
      "text": "By the Qur’an, full of wisdom,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 440,
      "ruku": 381,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3708,
      "text": "You [O Muhammad] are indeed one of the messengers,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 440,
      "ruku": 381,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3709,
      "text": "on a straight path,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 440,
      "ruku": 381,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3710,
      "text": "[This is] a revelation from the All-Mighty, Most Merciful,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 440,
      "ruku": 381,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3711,
      "text": "so that you warn a people whose forefathers were not warned, so they are heedless.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 440,
      "ruku": 381,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3712,
      "text": "The decree [of punishment] has been passed against most of them, for they will not believe.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 440,
      "ruku": 381,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3713,
      "text": "[It is as if] We have placed shackles around their necks up to their chins, so their heads are forced to remain up,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 440,
      "ruku": 381,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3714,
      "text": "and We have placed a barrier before them and a barrier behind them, and have blocked their vision so they cannot see[2].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 440,
      "ruku": 381,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3715,
      "text": "It is the same to them whether you warn them or not, they will not believe.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 440,
      "ruku": 381,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3716,
      "text": "You can only warn one who follows the Reminder[3] and fears the Most Compassionate unseen. So give him glad tidings of forgiveness and a generous reward.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 440,
      "ruku": 381,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3717,
      "text": "It is We Who give life to the dead, and record what they send forth and what they leave behind, and We keep an account of everything in a clear Record[4].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
